  unitName: Holy Alvitr (EU)
  unitId: 750114
  unitNumber: 7033
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Having observed the grace
    of the better martial artist all her life, her senses and powers are stronger
    than ever. She has taken it upon herself to cover for another bringer of soul
    who is not doing her job. Unlike others, she is unaffected by this burden and
    grows in strength.
  summonDesc: What a bright day! Greetings summoner.
  fusionDesc: I'm quicker now. Stronger too... Very promising!
  evoDesc: Stronger claws! Stronger Mind!
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
